   "text": "Basic vectors"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "What is a vector?"
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- Vectors represent a movement of a certain **magnitude** (size) in a given **direction**\n- You should have already come across **vectors** when translating functions of graphs\n- They appear in many contexts of maths including **mechanics** for modelling forces\n- Vectors can be represented in different ways such as a **column vector** or as an **i and j unit vector**"
  },
