  {
   "type": "callout",
   "variant": "exam-tip",
   "label": "Exam Hint",
   "md": "- Think of vectors like a journey from one place to another.\n- Diagrams can help, if there isn’t one, draw one.\n- In your exam you can’t write in **bold **so should <u>underline</u> your vector notation."
